---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE.name}>
  <article class="prose prose-sm sm:prose-base max-w-none">
    <h1>{SITE.name}</h1>

    <p>
      I'm a data scientist working across global health and climate policy, based in Berlin. I hold
      an MSc in Data Science for Public Policy from the Hertie School, and I've worked with the WHO
      Pandemic Hub, the Mercator Research Institute on Global Commons and Climate Change, and CPC
      Analytics, using methods ranging from Bayesian modeling to NLP and network analysis.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can see what I've worked on on the <a href="/work">work</a> page, or read more{' '}
      <a href="/about">about</a> me. I'm reachable at{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
